264
00:16:42,279 --> 00:16:44,138
[While checking the found school supplies]
- That’s Sakuya’s?
- Yeah.

265
00:16:44,139 --> 00:16:45,729
[YUSHI suddenly gets startled alone]

266
00:16:45,730 --> 00:16:46,758
Oh my gosh.

267
00:16:48,048 --> 00:16:51,113
[Turn the other way and do it again]

268
00:16:51,450 --> 00:16:52,664
He gets scared so easily.

269
00:16:52,665 --> 00:16:54,111
Why are they so cute though?

270
00:16:54,359 --> 00:16:55,486
Nothing on the upper floor?

271
00:16:55,487 --> 00:16:57,316
- Nothing upstairs.
- There’s nothing on the upper floor.

272
00:16:57,317 --> 00:16:58,977
We need to hurry up and go find them now.

273
00:16:59,491 --> 00:17:04,359
[Phone notification sound]
We got a message.

274
00:17:04,361 --> 00:17:05,199
RYO, did you find yours?

275
00:17:06,430 --> 00:17:07,478
I found RYO’s.

276
00:17:07,479 --> 00:17:09,457
[Hint]

277
00:17:09,458 --> 00:17:11,385
- “Save the Earth.”
- Where is this place?

278
00:17:11,386 --> 00:17:13,876
“Save the Earth.”

279
00:17:14,877 --> 00:17:16,298
Did you check everything here?

280
00:17:16,299 --> 00:17:17,292
We have been upstairs.

281
00:17:17,294 --> 00:17:18,199
Haven’t checked here yet?

282
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,693
Then I’ll go check this area.

283
00:17:20,134 --> 00:17:23,685
[NCT WISH splits up]
Isn’t it here?

284
00:17:24,172 --> 00:17:25,635
Why is it so dark though?

285
00:17:27,657 --> 00:17:29,774
It’s so dark.

286
00:17:31,589 --> 00:17:34,807
We haven’t found ours yet.

287
00:17:34,808 --> 00:17:37,689
I’ve already found three of the others’.

288
00:17:37,690 --> 00:17:39,241
But I haven’t found ours.

289
00:17:39,242 --> 00:17:42,112
[SION ? / RIKU: compass / YUSHI ?]
[JAEHEE: secret pen / RYO: scissors / SAKUYA: eraser]

290
00:17:42,471 --> 00:17:45,558
[The frequency calling for the school supplies]

291
00:17:46,055 --> 00:17:48,635
We need to find SION's.

292
00:17:49,417 --> 00:17:51,340
No.

293
00:17:51,582 --> 00:17:54,953
[RYO, who was alone, sets out after seeing the hint]
I wanna go.

294
00:17:54,954 --> 00:17:58,132
[Everyone doing their best to find the school supplies]
What the? “Save the Earth” x3

295
00:17:58,133 --> 00:17:59,098
What? x3

296
00:17:59,099 --> 00:18:00,067
“Save the Earth.”

297
00:18:00,068 --> 00:18:01,674
[(Freezes)]
Is it here?

298
00:18:01,675 --> 00:18:03,044
Why, what's going on? What is it?

299
00:18:03,045 --> 00:18:04,163
Why x3

300
00:18:04,164 --> 00:18:07,862
[SAKUYA senses something strange]

301
00:18:09,027 --> 00:18:11,296
[JAEHEE spots something too?]

302
00:18:11,297 --> 00:18:15,345
[← Poster from the hint]

303
00:18:15,633 --> 00:18:17,479
“Save the Earth.”

304
00:18:18,745 --> 00:18:20,487
It’s here.

305
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:27,767
[A protractor stuck on the poster]

306
00:18:28,181 --> 00:18:31,312
[The moment he carefully peeled off]

307
00:18:34,367 --> 00:18:36,673
Got it.

308
00:18:43,316 --> 00:18:45,235
[A full-powered scream]

309
00:18:52,051 --> 00:18:55,008
Now I'm the seeker.

310
00:18:56,096 --> 00:19:01,222
Better hide well, or your hair will show.

311
00:19:02,412 --> 00:19:06,226
[Hide-and-seek begins]

312
00:19:06,227 --> 00:19:09,822
[The seeker awakens from inside the poster]

313
00:19:11,192 --> 00:19:16,228
Better hide well, or your hair will show.

314
00:19:16,757 --> 00:19:19,513
[RYO is on the 3rd floor of the practice building]
Better hide well.

315
00:19:19,837 --> 00:19:21,678
[(Confused)]
I see your clothes peeking out.

316
00:19:23,218 --> 00:19:27,057
[YUSHI hides in the lab across the hall]

317
00:19:27,753 --> 00:19:29,785
Hey, hide! x3

318
00:19:30,377 --> 00:19:32,613
[Practice building 3F: RYO, RIKU, YUSHI]
Better hide well.

319
00:19:32,614 --> 00:19:36,069
[RIKU rushes into a nearby lab]
I see RIKU.

320
00:19:36,070 --> 00:19:38,855
[JAEHEE, who came down last]
Hey, hide! x3

321
00:19:41,181 --> 00:19:43,762
[← RYO]
[Accidentally meets up with RYO]

322
00:19:43,763 --> 00:19:46,523
[SAKUYA and SION also on 2F of the practice building]

323
00:19:48,881 --> 00:19:51,901
[Practice building 3F: RYO, JAEHEE, RIKU, YUSHI]
[2F: SAKUYA, SION]

324
00:19:51,902 --> 00:19:55,395
[Will they be able to finish the game safely?]

325
00:19:55,396 --> 00:19:59,263
[Remaining time for hide-and-seek]

326
00:19:59,264 --> 00:20:01,645
[← RYO]
[← JAEHEE]

327
00:20:01,646 --> 00:20:04,085
I found SION’s school supply.

328
00:20:04,397 --> 00:20:06,896
[← SION’s protractor]
SION’s.

329
00:20:07,964 --> 00:20:09,018
RYO, RYO, RYO!

330
00:20:09,019 --> 00:20:10,667
I saw a ghost earlier.

331
00:20:10,668 --> 00:20:11,519
A ghost?

332
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:12,567
A ghost!

333
00:20:12,765 --> 00:20:15,346
Right when I took it out, a face popped out.

334
00:20:15,754 --> 00:20:16,985
Isn’t that the seeker?

335
00:20:16,986 --> 00:20:19,038
Are you saying the seeker is a ghost?

336
00:20:19,341 --> 00:20:22,258
[Phone notification sound]

337
00:20:22,259 --> 00:20:24,640
[(Surprised)]

338
00:20:25,311 --> 00:20:27,482
Why is this so scary, seriously?

339
00:20:28,746 --> 00:20:32,166
"Hide-and-seek starts now."

340
00:20:32,167 --> 00:20:35,299
"The game time is 4,444 seconds."

341
00:20:35,300 --> 00:20:38,529
Why is it 4,444 seconds.

342
00:20:38,919 --> 00:20:43,318
"If you get caught by the seeker, you’ll immediately be trapped somewhere."

343
00:20:43,559 --> 00:20:48,840
"Hide-and-seek is a game where survival rate is very important."

344
00:20:49,069 --> 00:20:55,892
"If the survival rate is over 50%, NCTzens will receive a big reward."

345
00:20:55,893 --> 00:20:59,666
"So please do your best to hide well."

346
00:21:01,328 --> 00:21:03,161
So that means

347
00:21:03,162 --> 00:21:05,839
(If over 50%) three people.

348
00:21:06,472 --> 00:21:08,824
We just need three people left, then.

349
00:21:09,604 --> 00:21:10,926
Okay, okay.

350
00:21:11,328 --> 00:21:13,778
Czennie, wait for us.

351
00:21:16,033 --> 00:21:18,085
[The seeker starts moving]

352
00:21:23,284 --> 00:21:25,294
[Height almost reaching the ceiling]

353
00:21:26,051 --> 00:21:29,187
So scary, so scary.

354
00:21:30,086 --> 00:21:31,338
Who is it?

355
00:21:44,180 --> 00:21:51,514
[Those who must hide]

356
00:21:51,515 --> 00:21:55,291
[And the one who must seek]

357
00:22:03,417 --> 00:22:06,450
[What will be the result of this survival game?]

358
00:22:08,523 --> 00:22:10,513
[Practice building 3rd floor]

359
00:22:10,514 --> 00:22:14,257
[↓ YUSHI]
[3F: JAEHEE, RYO / 2F: YUSHI]
It’s been ages since I played hide-and-seek.

360
00:22:14,258 --> 00:22:16,978
The last time I played hide-and-seek

361
00:22:17,321 --> 00:22:20,416
I think it was about six years ago.

362
00:22:20,417 --> 00:22:23,060
Six years ago? How old was I then?

363
00:22:23,813 --> 00:22:26,853
So elementary school was the last time.

364
00:22:27,053 --> 00:22:28,317
[While YUSHI reminisces about the past]

365
00:22:28,318 --> 00:22:29,951
I should check somewhere else.

366
00:22:29,952 --> 00:22:31,026
Why?

367
00:22:31,027 --> 00:22:32,365
I need to find SION.

368
00:22:32,800 --> 00:22:36,777
[JAEHEE, anxious about SION]
- Where did SION go?
- I don’t know.

369
00:22:41,026 --> 00:22:42,462
What the x3

370
00:22:46,343 --> 00:22:49,791
[Steps on a trap and returns to starting point]

371
00:22:51,704 --> 00:22:53,875
[RIKU →]
[RIKU moves to a classroom on the 2nd floor of the learning building]

372
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:56,050
This is seriously scary.

373
00:22:56,051 --> 00:22:57,448
What do I do?

374
00:22:58,330 --> 00:23:01,444
[Practice building 2F / SION / SAKUYA]

375
00:23:02,097 --> 00:23:04,139
[← SION]

376
00:23:04,658 --> 00:23:08,530
[SION adjusts his hiding spot]

377
00:23:08,811 --> 00:23:11,434
[← SAKUYA]
[SAKUYA lets out nothing but a sigh]

378
00:23:11,742 --> 00:23:14,341
This is too scary.

379
00:23:21,630 --> 00:23:24,393
[The seeker appears on the 2nd floor of the practice building]

380
00:23:27,385 --> 00:23:31,167
[Practice building 2F / Seeker / SION / SAKUYA]
Since it looks like the seeker came this way, I’ll turn off the light for a bit.

381
00:23:33,421 --> 00:23:38,292
[← SION / ← Seeker]
[The seeker passes the lab where SION is hiding]

382
00:23:43,813 --> 00:23:46,149
[Sound of the seeker’s cane]

383
00:23:47,877 --> 00:23:50,084
[Slowly getting closer to SAKUYA]

384
00:23:59,687 --> 00:24:01,900
[← SAKUYA]

385
00:24:06,895 --> 00:24:10,474
[The seeker fails to spot SAKUYA behind the shelf]

386
00:24:11,085 --> 00:24:16,952
[Goes upstairs without catching anyone]

387
00:24:19,437 --> 00:24:21,285
Wait a minute.

388
00:24:22,574 --> 00:24:23,431
Does that even make sense?

389
00:24:23,432 --> 00:24:24,964
Why is this so scary?

390
00:24:27,157 --> 00:24:28,938
[Sound of swallowing]

391
00:24:28,939 --> 00:24:31,839
Wait.

392
00:24:32,597 --> 00:24:34,033
I think the seeker is gone.

393
00:24:34,034 --> 00:24:36,116
So they move around making that much noise.

394
00:24:36,117 --> 00:24:38,543
I guess hiding wasn’t the best idea after all.

395
00:24:48,451 --> 00:24:52,246
[SION moves to the lab across the hall]

396
00:24:57,435 --> 00:25:00,941
[Practice building 3F / JAEHEE, RYO, YUSHI]
Hey, what was that sound?

397
00:25:01,950 --> 00:25:04,392
[(Lights off)]

398
00:25:05,098 --> 00:25:07,112
[(Crawling deeper under the desk)]

399
00:25:07,503 --> 00:25:11,062
[← JAEHEE & RYO / YUSHI →]

400
00:25:12,369 --> 00:25:13,802
I’m scared.

401
00:25:14,625 --> 00:25:18,218
[YUSHI →]
[Passes by YUSHI]

402
00:25:18,219 --> 00:25:20,899
[Gets closer to where JAEHEE and RYO are hiding]

403
00:25:23,561 --> 00:25:25,709
[← RYO]
[← JAEHEE]

404
00:25:30,197 --> 00:25:32,815
[Just passes by]

405
00:25:41,080 --> 00:25:43,183
The cane sound got farther away.

406
00:25:44,727 --> 00:25:46,976
[Sound of swallowing]

407
00:25:48,799 --> 00:25:50,828
[(Signal that he survived)]

408
00:25:56,368 --> 00:25:59,280
[The seeker goes back down to the 2nd floor of the practice building]

409
00:26:00,061 --> 00:26:01,696
I hear the cane sound.

410
00:26:05,781 --> 00:26:07,151
[← SION]

411
00:26:07,152 --> 00:26:09,378
[← Seeker]

412
00:26:17,296 --> 00:26:21,970
[Stops in front of the lab SION is hiding]

413
00:26:25,624 --> 00:26:29,834
[Enters the room]

414
00:26:33,941 --> 00:26:39,302
[Starts checking every corner]

415
00:26:43,813 --> 00:26:45,689
Found you! SION!

416
00:26:53,582 --> 00:26:55,763
No...

417
00:26:56,112 --> 00:26:59,173
[Phone notification sound]
[Member SION has been caught and trapped in the confinement room]

418
00:26:59,174 --> 00:27:01,153
SION got caught.

419
00:27:04,888 --> 00:27:07,445
SION doesn’t have that thing.

420
00:27:07,446 --> 00:27:09,660
That... the school supply.

421
00:27:09,661 --> 00:27:12,312
We need to find Sion’s school supply.

422
00:27:13,501 --> 00:27:16,065
[SION’s school supply already found by JAEHEE]

423
00:27:16,504 --> 00:27:22,910
[Heads to the confinement room after reading the message]

424
00:27:23,776 --> 00:27:25,689
Huh? Where is this place?

425
00:27:27,368 --> 00:27:31,267
[SION enters the confinement room]

426
00:27:32,729 --> 00:27:35,652
["Confinement room rules"]
[1. Find the test paper with your name on it and sit down]

427
00:27:35,653 --> 00:27:38,788
[2. Once you're handcuffed, confinement is complete]

428
00:27:41,444 --> 00:27:43,513
So I need the protractor.

429
00:27:44,102 --> 00:27:46,323
Protractor!

430
00:27:47,352 --> 00:27:51,090
[Practice building 3F / RYO / YUSHI / JAEHEE]

431
00:27:51,091 --> 00:27:52,656
I can’t go that way.

432
00:27:56,760 --> 00:28:00,495
[← SAKUYA]
We need to find SION’s.

433
00:28:00,774 --> 00:28:03,490
[SAKUYA doesn't know about the protractor yet]
But what if I go out and

434
00:28:03,790 --> 00:28:06,166
[Struggling with himself]
get caught...

435
00:28:06,543 --> 00:28:09,825
But even if I get caught, I have the eraser, so it’s fine.

436
00:28:12,513 --> 00:28:14,579
Wait x4

437
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:20,352
Should I go find SION’s school supply?

438
00:28:22,824 --> 00:28:26,715
[(Deep in thought)]

439
00:28:28,914 --> 00:28:30,294
I should go.

440
00:28:36,341 --> 00:28:37,630
It’s okay.

441
00:28:41,804 --> 00:28:42,967
[(Stops)]

442
00:28:42,968 --> 00:28:44,054
Actually, I don’t think this is a good idea.

443
00:28:45,953 --> 00:28:48,183
I really don’t think this is okay.

444
00:28:48,928 --> 00:28:50,246
What even is this?

445
00:28:52,948 --> 00:28:54,538
Maybe I should just die.

446
00:28:56,673 --> 00:28:59,629
Maybe I should just sleep instead.

447
00:29:08,898 --> 00:29:11,662
[← SAKUYA]
The seeker won’t open this, right?

448
00:29:11,663 --> 00:29:14,757
I’m scared.

449
00:29:14,991 --> 00:29:18,224
[RIKU enters the science lab on the 3rd floor of the learning building]

450
00:29:24,814 --> 00:29:26,078
Alright!

451
00:29:26,402 --> 00:29:29,425
[Found a hiding spot]

452
00:29:31,867 --> 00:29:34,354
[Looks outside]

453
00:29:34,828 --> 00:29:36,557
[Sound of the seeker’s cane]

454
00:29:36,854 --> 00:29:41,958
[Quickly hides inside the cabinet]

455
00:29:46,375 --> 00:29:50,802
[RIKU and the seeker are getting closer]

456
00:29:51,041 --> 00:29:53,821
[← Seeker / RIKU →]

457
00:29:55,449 --> 00:29:57,293
I’m scared.

458
00:29:57,294 --> 00:29:58,984
Seriously.

459
00:29:59,462 --> 00:30:01,573
[Stop in front of the science lab]

460
00:30:10,252 --> 00:30:11,355
The seeker is here.

461
00:30:11,356 --> 00:30:13,649
It's here, it's here.

462
00:30:13,650 --> 00:30:14,526
[(Covers mouth)]

463
00:30:20,301 --> 00:30:23,248
[The seeker comes inside]

464
00:30:25,193 --> 00:30:27,142
There’s no one here.

465
00:30:38,152 --> 00:30:41,238
[SUMBAKꓘOKJIL]
